tryb.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Choose how many questions you want to see.

**Why:** Basic is enough for most people. Advanced shows every option and extra devices. You can change the mode later in “Configure”.{porada}{galeria}

mam.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Tick what you have. The wizard searched Home Assistant and ticked what it found.

**Why:** The wizard shows only the steps and features for ticked devices. You can add the rest later in “Configure”.

Found: {znalezione}{porada}{galeria}

urzadzenie.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Choose the motor (a shade or a gate), give it a name and pick the room.

**Why:** Motor HA controls this motor. Talk to Assist using the device name, e.g. “close Kitchen pleated blind”.{porada}{galeria}

rodzaj.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Choose exactly what you have.

**Why:** The card draws this device, and the automation knows what it can use.{porada}{galeria}

lamele.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Set how the slats tilt.

**Why:** You let light in without raising the blind.{porada}{galeria}

kolory.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Choose the colour of the shade and the frame.

**Why:** The window on screen looks like the real one.{porada}{galeria}

okno.description:
{pasek}

**What:** How many sashes the window has and how big it is on the card.

**Why:** Each sash can have its own motor.{porada}{galeria}

czujniki.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Choose the window and door opening sensors.

**Why:** The card shows a tilted or open sash, and the lock never lowers the shade onto an open window.{porada}{galeria}

fotokomorka.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Pick the gate obstacle sensor and the state that means “something is in the gate”.

**Why:** The card shows the obstacle and you can get a notification. The photocell in the controller still stops the gate by itself.{porada}{galeria}

silnik.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Enter the full travel time or leave 0.

**Why:** The drawing moves as fast as the real motor. With 0 the card learns the time by itself after a few moves.{porada}{galeria}

pogoda.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Choose the weather and outdoor sensors.

**Why:** Real weather shows behind the glass, and the automation protects the shade from wind, rain and sun.{porada}{galeria}

domownicy.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Choose presence, motion and household sensors.

**Why:** The shade can react to whether someone is in the room or at home.{porada}{galeria}

automatyka.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Turn on the features that may move the shade by themselves.

**Why:** Your home looks after the shades without writing automations. All are off until you turn them on.{porada}{galeria}

ustawienia.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Adjust the features you turned on.

**Why:** The defaults suit most homes.{porada}{galeria}

powiadomienia.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Choose what to tell you about.

**Why:** You know right away which device has a problem. Notifications go to HA and, if you choose, to your phone.{porada}{galeria}

panel.description:
{pasek}

**What:** Which dashboard to add the card to.

**Why:** The card appears by itself, nothing to click.{porada}{galeria}

